  "body": {
    "comment": "As a DRep and SPO, i am voting ❌NO on this proposal, because we need a minMargin parameter of at least 5% first before thinking about to lower minPoolCost even more. Does not make any sense to me, there is still a threshold which puts small pools in a disadvantage. Getting rid of minPoolCost while introduction minMargin is the way to go! But i am against any lowering of minPoolCost without introducing a minMargin parameter with a sustainable number parameter first."
  },
  "hashAlgorithm": "blake2b-256"
